ui_print("====================================================");
ui_print("   NOVAOS 16 HYBRID LITE - VIETNAM SPECIAL EDITION  ");
ui_print("   Target: Xiaomi 8 Series (dipper / ginkgo / olive)");
ui_print("   Base  : Pure AOSP LineageOS + KernelSU + SUSFS   ");
